title: scene_lilian
---
<<bg town_afternoon>>

On his way to the town, Ariel was trying to comprehend what just happened.
It all started to catch up to him.
He just met an angel.
The Creator's messenger itself.
It was surreal.
Maybe he was dreaming?
Hallucinating?
How could he be sure that wasn’t just psychosis?
Maybe he should talk to Father Faust about it?

<<show ariel basic right>>

Ariel just stepped into the town, but maybe it's best to go back to the church?

???: Hey! Don’t ignore me!

???: Listen to me!

???: What you do is wrong! 

But then he heard some very sweet and melodic voice filled with clear frustration.
That's probably some town person…
But maybe talking to them is a good start? 
Yes, Faust told him that talking isn’t particularly effective, but it’s always worth a shot.
Ariel walked towards the voice, which only grew louder. 

???: Please just listen to me! I’m trying to help you all!!

<<show lilian basic left>>

Ariel wasn’t expecting to see…
Yet another angel.
A smaller, frustrated figure in front of him that was clearly trying to catch people's attention…
People were walking around the angel, completely ignoring its presence.

Ariel: I don’t think they can see you, you know?

Ariel said gently not to startle the little angel, which jumped a little bit anyway.


The angel turned its head towards Ariel, looking right at him with its big eyes. 

// <<show lilian silly left>>

Angel: OH! I-I know that!
Angel: Of course I do!

An angel made a cute pose sticking his tongue out.
But despite its words, Ariel wasn't sure about their honesty.
That little angel was clearly frustrated just a second ago…

// <<show lilian basic left>>

Angel: But you can see me!
Angel: Hi! Hi, I’m Lilian!
Lilian: I’m… a spirit guide in training!
Lilian:But worry not!

Lilian: I’m very good already, so you’re in good hands priest!  
-> Are you sure you know what you're doing?
   Lilian: Yes, I know what I’m doing!
   Lilian: What kind of question is that! 
-> You’re an angel after all! I’m sure you’ll be helpful!
   Lilian: Of course I will! I can’t wait to prove it to you!
-> Good hands, huh? I’m sure you know how to use them.
   Lilian: Oh.. Oh, I-I’m not sure what you mean by that…

Lilian: You’ve probably met my colleague already!
Lilian: You know!
Lilian: Tall, long hair and all that very much angelic aura.
Lilian: Marchain is awesome, but…
Lilian: But I can do better!
Lilian: And you can only have one spirit guide!
Lilian: That’s why unlike some, I already started doing some research for you!
Lilian: I’ve been observing those humans for a while already, and I gathered plenty of information for you!

// <<show lilian silly left>>

Lilian: Aren’t I awesome? 

// <<show ariel blush right>>

Ariel smiled gently, feeling a little bit nervous around the young angel.
His excitement was cute and all, but he seemed to be… inexperienced.

// <<show ariel basic right>>

Is that how Faust was looking at him earlier?
-> I really appreciate your hard work. Thank you for doing so much already! 
   Lilian: You really think… Thank you!! 
-> Yes, yes, you are awesome, and very cute as well.
   Lilian: Oh…
   Lilian: Oh, thank you…

// <<show lilian silly left>>

Lilian: Oh, and as your spirit guide I can also-! 

Lilian was interrupted by a loud voice.
Ariel knew this voice… but now it was more authoritarian.
Marchain..?

Marchain: Lilian! You little rascal
Marcgain: Come here this instant! 

Lilian looked at Ariel as if to apologize for being interrupted, when the conversation started getting interesting.
This little angel's excitement was almost contagious.
Ariel smiled back at him.

Ariel: It’s okay. Duty calls, right?

Lilian: Yes… Duty.
Lilian: I’m sorry!
Lilian: We’re going to meet again!

Lilian scurried away, flapping his little wings like a small dove that was just learning how to fly.

<<hide lilian>>

It made Ariel chuckle a little bit.
Adorable. 
The sun started settling down.
Ariel probably should go back to the church.
Despite everything, he feels that staying in this town after the sun settles under the horizon is just a stupid decision.

<<hide ariel>>

<<jump scene_ludus>>

===
